{
  "description": "Certificate of lawfulness (proposed) for internal changes to remodel and refurbish the building so that it is suitable and safe to accommodate the user groups and intended operations for the Hub. These include a new Part M-compliant reception desk, amendments to 3 internal partitions to create the right size rooms, replacements and repairs to rooflights, windows, floor finishes and joinery to upgrade the worn-out interior and make it suitable for its new use. A replacement boiler and upgrades to the building services will bring the services back into use and make them safe for the new use. Externally, the broken tarmac and play surface will be repaired in a limited area, and a clearance of some of the overgrowth will make the paths usable again.\r\rThere are no proposed changes to access, hard-standings, means of enclosure or drainage, and no changes to the external fabric of the building, other than the repair of selected rooflights and windows.",
